      "post_id": "10243",
      "author_handle": "mrs_ping",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 19 years 5 months ago",
      "body": "Hi all,\nWe have finally booked our trip to the USA for the summer and we booked with BA.  Just wondered what they were like with children.  We have the front seats as we have a cot for Elani, so that is extra leg room, so thats a good thing.  To be honest i am dreading it, 7 hours with a 1 year old....arrrgghhhh.  I am banking on her good looks to win the other passengers over!!!  Plus what do i take on board?????  They provide a meal for her, but what is it like?  What food should i take, activities to keep her occupied...help!!!!\n😲  😲  🤪",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-1157/#10243",
      "raw_file": "_raw/forums-deep/justparents/responses/45deab73b46b9277f7e0.html",
      "page_url": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-1157/",
