    },
    {
      "post_id": "10246",
      "author_handle": "bunnigirl",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 19 years 5 months ago",
      "body": "hey hu i thought the same about my daughter but she was a star and they are great on b with kids just take her something to play with as for the food side of it i dont think u r allowed to take food on a aircraft that will be something u check out first before u pack something up for hr but like i said she will love it to her it will be like being in the car as my daughter described its like floating through a bowl of ice cream in among the clouds have a great time\nxxx",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-1157/#10246",
